            "repere": "Paragraphe · Will I Have To Pay Customs Duties On My ",
            "text": "<b>Will I Have To Pay C</b><b style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.08px;\">ustoms Duties On My US Order?</b>",
