        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1603",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Will I have to pay customs duties on my ",
            "text": "<span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">Will I have to pay customs duties on my US order?</span><br style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); max-width: 100%;\">&nbsp;Yes. From&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">September 1, 2025</span>, all orders shipped from the UK to the US are subject to customs duties. These duties are set and collected by US Customs, not Plantmade.<br style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">How does it work?</span>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1610",
            "repere": "Texte · After your order ships, US Customs may c",
            "text": "After your order ships, US Customs may contact you directly by email or phone to arrange payment.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1611",
            "repere": "Texte · Duties are not included in your Plantmad",
            "text": "Duties are not included in your Plantmade order total and are not payable to us.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1612",
            "repere": "Texte · Please make sure your email and phone nu",
            "text": "Please make sure your email and phone number are correct at checkout so Customs can reach you.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1613",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · What happens if I don’t pay? If duties a",
            "text": "<span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">What happens if I don’t pay?</span><br style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); max-width: 100%;\">&nbsp;If duties are unpaid or the package goes unclaimed, the order will return to us. In this case, we can only issue a&nbsp;<span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">partial refund</span>, because carriers charge us high fees when shipments don’t clear customs.<br style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700; max-width: 100%;\">What are you doing to help?</span><br style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); max-width: 100%;\">&nbsp;We’re working on offering shipping options where duties are included at checkout. This will remove the extra step and make the process easier for you.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
